---
title: Umbra Auth and Session Flow (Internal)
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser (React SPA)
  participant DJ as Django + DRF
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
    Note over B,DB: Login
    B->>DJ: POST /api/auth/login/ {username, password}
    Note right of DJ: @permission_classes([AllowAny])
    Note right of DJ: LoginRateThrottle: 5/min
    DJ->>DB: authenticate(username, password)
    DB-->>DJ: User object or None
    alt credentials valid
      DJ->>DJ: login(request, user) — creates row in django_session table
      DJ->>DJ: get_token(request) — issues csrftoken
      DJ-->>B: 200 {id, username} + Set-Cookie: sessionid=X; csrftoken=Y
      Note left of B: SPA reads csrftoken from cookie (not HttpOnly)
      Note left of B: sessionid is HttpOnly — cannot be read by JS
    else invalid credentials
      DJ-->>B: 401 {detail: Invalid credentials}
    end
  end

  rect rgb(200, 255, 200)
    Note over B,DB: Authenticated API Request (e.g. PATCH item)
    B->>DJ: PATCH /api/lists/1/items/5/ + Cookie: sessionid=X + Header: X-CSRFToken: Y
    Note right of DJ: SessionAuthentication.authenticate()
    Note right of DJ: Step 1: resolve user from sessionid cookie
    Note right of DJ: Step 2: validate X-CSRFToken == csrftoken cookie (mutating methods only)
    Note right of DJ: UserRateThrottle: 300/min
    DJ->>DB: SELECT django_session WHERE session_key=X
    DB-->>DJ: Session valid — user resolved
    DJ->>DB: TodoItem.objects.get(pk=5, list__owner=user)
    DB-->>DJ: TodoItem instance
    DJ-->>B: 200 {id, title, completed, priority, ...}
  end

  rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
    Note over B,DB: Logout
    B->>DJ: POST /api/auth/logout/ + Cookie: sessionid=X
    Note right of DJ: @permission_classes([AllowAny])
    Note right of DJ: Works even if session already expired (no 403)
    DJ->>DJ: logout(request) — deletes session row from django_session
    DJ-->>B: 204 No Content
    Note left of B: SPA sets AuthContext.user = null, navigate to /login
  end
